# flux-system

`task flux:bootstrap` generates `gotk-components.yaml` and `gotk-sync.yaml`. A
`kustomize build` of the cluster root fails until they exist. Commit them and
never hand-edit them; patches go in `kustomization.yaml`.

`--path` stays `./kubernetes/clusters/{{ cluster_name }}`. The procedure is in the
template's [PRE-SETUP.md](https://github.com/ericsweiss/weisssrv-cluster-template/blob/main/docs/PRE-SETUP.md).
